 * anthropic-kind model request — bundle `E2e` (resolveAnthropicRequestMetadataUserId,
 * provider-kind gated ONLY, never plan-gated; both dispatch loops call it) →
 * `UIo` (createAnthropicRequestMetadataUserId):
 *
